  },
  {
    "text": "Tianjin University",
    "x": 718,
    "y": 90,
    "width": 111,
    "height": 11.19011111111111,
    "size_pt": 26
  },
  {
    "text": "Motivation",
    "x": 20,
    "y": 156,
    "width": 402,
    "height": 18.07633333333333,
    "size_pt": 42
  },
  {
    "text": "1. Text-based references can drift between similar objects. Coordinate-only grounding lacks explicit identity tracking.",
    "x": 22,
    "y": 386,
    "width": 398,
    "height": 23.311555555555554,
    "size_pt": 28
  },
  {
    "text": "2. A model may correctly analyze object A, then silently point to object B. This reasoning-to-answer misalignment breaks reliable visual grounding.",
    "x": 22,
    "y": 416,
    "width": 398,
    "height": 23.311555555555554,
    "size_pt": 28
  },
  {
    "text": "Key Insight: Persistent Identity",
    "x": 448,
    "y": 156,
    "width": 373,
    "height": 18.07633333333333,
    "size_pt": 42
  },
  {
    "text": "Implicit references",
    "x": 454,
    "y": 191,
    "width": 360,
    "height": 11.19011111111111,
    "size_pt": 26
  },
  {
    "text": "a cup",
    "x": 457,
    "y": 215,
    "width": 98,
    "height": 10.759722222222221,
    "size_pt": 25
  },
  {
    "text": "it",
    "x": 583,
    "y": 215,
    "width": 98,
    "height": 10.759722222222221,
    "size_pt": 25
  },
  {
    "text": "the target",
    "x": 709,
    "y": 215,
    "width": 98,
    "height": 10.759722222222221,
    "size_pt": 25
  },
  {
    "text": "Which instance is carried forward?",
    "x": 454,
    "y": 240,
    "width": 360,
    "height": 9.468555555555554,
    "size_pt": 22
  },
  {
    "text": "PinCoT: persistent identity",
    "x": 454,
    "y": 261,
    "width": 360,
    "height": 11.19011111111111,
    "size_pt": 26
  },
  {
    "text": "obj_01",
    "x": 457,
    "y": 285,
    "width": 98,
    "height": 10.759722222222221,
    "size_pt": 25
  },
  {
    "text": "obj_01",
    "x": 583,
    "y": 285,
    "width": 98,
    "height": 10.759722222222221,
    "size_pt": 25
  },
  {
    "text": "obj_01",
    "x": 709,
    "y": 285,
    "width": 98,
    "height": 10.759722222222221,
    "size_pt": 25
  },
  {
    "text": "• Spatial references are usually isolated annotations, without explicit identity tracking during reasoning.",
    "x": 454,
    "y": 316,
    "width": 360,
    "height": 22.91644444444444,
    "size_pt": 28
  },
  {
    "text": "• PinCoT binds each entity to a name, ID, view and point. Later steps reuse the same ID.",
    "x": 454,
    "y": 349,
    "width": 360,
    "height": 22.91644444444444,
    "size_pt": 28
  },
  {
    "text": "• Our insight: visual anchors act as persistent reasoning variables, making each step traceable to visual evidence.",
    "x": 454,
    "y": 382,
    "width": 280,
    "height": 34.37466666666666,
    "size_pt": 28
  },
  {
    "text": "QR\nPLACEHOLDER",
    "x": 762,
    "y": 403,
    "width": 44,
    "height": 13.772444444444442,
    "size_pt": 16
  },
  {
    "text": "PAPER / CODE",
    "x": 750,
    "y": 437,
    "width": 68,
    "height": 7.31661111111111,
    "size_pt": 17
  },
  {
    "text": "Our Method: RoboPIN / PinCoT",
    "x": 20,
    "y": 454,
    "width": 801,
    "height": 19.797888888888885,
    "size_pt": 46
  },
  {
    "text": "A. How PinCoT Reasons",
    "x": 22,
    "y": 487,
    "width": 793,
    "height": 13.772444444444442,
    "size_pt": 32
  },
  {
    "text": "1. Observe",
    "x": 22,
    "y": 508,
    "width": 185,
    "height": 11.620499999999998,
    "size_pt": 27
  },
  {
    "text": "2. Introduce an anchor",
    "x": 225,
    "y": 508,
    "width": 185,
    "height": 11.620499999999998,
    "size_pt": 27
  },
  {
    "text": "3. Reuse identity",
    "x": 428,
    "y": 508,
    "width": 185,
    "height": 11.620499999999998,
    "size_pt": 27
  },
  {
    "text": "4. Ground the answer",
    "x": 631,
    "y": 508,
    "width": 185,
    "height": 11.620499999999998,
    "size_pt": 27
  },
  {
    "text": "How did the camera rotate\nbetween the two views?",
    "x": 22,
    "y": 526,
    "width": 185,
    "height": 18.17511111111111,
    "size_pt": 23
  },
  {
    "text": "View 0",
    "x": 22,
    "y": 619,
    "width": 86,
    "height": 8.177388888888888,
    "size_pt": 19
  },
  {
    "text": "View 1",
    "x": 117,
    "y": 619,
    "width": 86,
    "height": 8.177388888888888,
    "size_pt": 19
  },
  {
    "text": "<obj name=\"microwave\"\n id=\"obj_01\" img_idx=\"0\"\n point=\"[634,576]\">",
    "x": 230,
    "y": 533,
    "width": 175,
    "height": 30.479999999999993,
    "size_pt": 24
  },
  {
    "text": "Introduce the entity once\nwith identity, view and point.\nThen refer to it by obj_01.",
    "x": 225,
    "y": 581,
    "width": 185,
    "height": 30.956249999999997,
    "size_pt": 25
  },
  {
    "text": "Same obj_01, new view:",
    "x": 428,
    "y": 531,
    "width": 185,
    "height": 10.759722222222221,
    "size_pt": 25
  },
  {
    "text": "View 0: [634,576]\nView 1: [844,706]",
    "x": 428,
    "y": 550,
    "width": 185,
    "height": 20.990277777777777,
    "size_pt": 25
  },
  {
    "text": "Its x-coordinate increases\nfrom 634 to 844: the object\nappears to shift right.",
    "x": 428,
    "y": 584,
    "width": 185,
    "height": 30.956249999999997,
    "size_pt": 25
  },
  {
    "text": "In this example, apparent\nobject motion is opposite\nto camera motion.",
    "x": 631,
    "y": 531,
    "width": 185,
    "height": 30.956249999999997,
    "size_pt": 25
  },
